          why: ["URLs and cookies are Layer 7 content; a packet filter does not parse them.", "Correct: IP header (addresses) and TCP/UDP header (ports), plus the protocol.", "MAC addresses change at every hop and are not what the slide's filter checks.", "Inspecting certificates needs a Layer 7 proxy."],
